data: {"id": "b5126ddb881e4da4-thinking-parallel_evidence-446", "run_id": "b5126ddb881e4da4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "关键事实已明确：\n- Pod 因 **Multus NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' not found** 而 Pending。\n- 事件显示：`Warning: NoNetworkFound (multus) - network-attachment-definition 'unavailable-network' not found in namespace 'aiops-case-05'`。\n- 同时 kubelet 反复报错：`FailedCreatePodSandBox - rpc error: failed to setup network for sandbox`。\n- YAML 确认 annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` 指向了一个不存在的网络定义。\n\n**结论：**\nPod 处于 ContainerCreating 状态的原因是 **Multus 网络插件无法找到指定的 NetworkAttachmentDe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788431872063, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

